// Avdiivka, part I, The first wave (Перша хвиля): 10 October 2023, dawn to noon, the northern shoulder. After the
// strongest fire preparation of the war in Donbas, columns of 20-40 vehicles of the 1st Army Corps' 114th Brigade
// and the 41st Army's 90th Tank Division cross the open fields from Krasnohorivka and Kamianka towards Stepove, the
// railway and the spoil heap, into the 47th Brigade's Bradleys and the 110th on the heap (c11 §2 10-12 Oct, §5,
// §6 set piece 1). The schema is bav_core::data and bav_sim::data; the map is map.ron.
(
    date: "10 October 2023",
    tally_date: "10 OCT 2023",
    // 05:40 to about 11:55 in the day's 1500 s: the preparation in the dark, the first column at first light
    // (sunrise 06:40), the last at mid-morning.
    day_start_min: 340.0,
    compression: 0.25,
    attacker: Ru,
    season: Autumn,
    // 10 October is the 283rd day of the year; Kyiv was on summer time, UTC+3.
    sun: Some((283, 3.0)),
    // The 47th flew thermal Mavics by then: key I.
    thermal: true,
    // Fictional, the 47th's: the player (a sighthound), the 55th's guns (anvil), the observers on the heap (crest),
    // the battalion's command post (flint).
    callsigns: (
        player: ("Khort", "Хорт"),
        guns: ("Kovadlo", "Ковадло"),
        op: ("Hrebin", "Гребінь"),
        command: ("Kremin", "Кремінь"),
    ),
    words: (
        briefing: r#"AVDIIVKA (АВДІЇВКА), THE NORTHERN SHOULDER
10 OCTOBER 2023, BEFORE DAWN

Avdiivka has been a fortified salient since 2014, ten kilometres from Donetsk. Its northern anchor is the coke
plant; north of the plant stands its spoil heap, and beyond the heap the village of Stepove on the railway.
Open stubble fields run from both towards Krasnohorivka and Kamianka, where the Russians are.

You are with the 47th Mechanised Brigade (47-ма ОМБр), moved here from Zaporizhzhia with little time to rest:
a drone operator and a fire controller at Stepove. The 110th holds the heap. The 55th Artillery Brigade's guns
are behind you, and for once there are shells.

Since four this morning their guns have not stopped. They will come at first light.

The day will run whether or not you do anything. What you do matters at the margin.

Mouse: right-drag to look, wheel to zoom.  WASD: fly the drone.  Q/E: turn.  R/F: climb/descend.
Left click: 155 mm fire mission (4 rounds).  Shift+click: RAAM mines.  Ctrl+click: HIMARS.  4: an FPV.
Space: ATGM teams AUTO / HOLD / FREE.  1/2 or Tab: drone / the observers on the heap.  I: thermal.  P: pause.  [ ]: time.
M: move the drone team when they find you.  3: into a position with an ATGM team.  Right button: the sight.  Left click: launch.

Press Enter."#,
        op_label: "OBSERVERS, THE HEAP'S FIRST TERRACE (СПОСТЕРІГАЧІ, ПЕРША ТЕРАСА ТЕРИКОНУ)",
        op_lost: "The observers on the heap are gone. No eyes from the height.",
        forward_belt: "the railway",
        plow_mine: "Mine under the plow. The lead tank's plow is gone, it keeps going.",
        mine_lines: [
            "Mine! He went off the track. That one's done.",
            "Another one. Tracks off.",
            "He drove right past the last one, same line. Mine.",
            "Boom. Mine. He's not moving.",
        ],
        registered: ("Я {guns}. Вогонь по пристріляній точці {n}.", "This is {guns}. Firing on registered point {n}."),
        closing: [
            "Across the whole salient that day a geolocated count found 70 Russian vehicles destroyed; by satellite, 109 in the first ten days.",
            "The second wave came on 19 October (the next part). The heap fell on 28 October. The city held until 17 February 2024.",
        ],
        keys: "R: the same morning again, across the same field.     Esc: quit.",
        sources: [
            (
                publisher: "Institute for the Study of War",
                date: "11 Oct 2023",
                title: "Russian Offensive Campaign Assessment",
                url: "https://understandingwar.org/research/russia-ukraine/russian-offensive-campaign-assessment_11-14/",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "OSW",
                date: "13 Oct 2023",
                title: "Battle of Avdiivka. Day 596 of the war",
                url: "https://www.osw.waw.pl/en/publikacje/analyses/2023-10-13/battle-avdiivka-day-596-war",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "Euromaidan Press",
                date: "16 Oct 2023",
                title: "Frontline report: Russia's failed frontal assault on Avdiivka coal spoil tip",
                url: "https://euromaidanpress.com/2023/10/16/frontline-report-russias-failed-frontal-assault-on-avdiivka-coal-spoil-tip-shows-russian-strategic-lapses/",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "Frontelligence Insight",
                date: "23 Oct 2023",
                title: "Avdiivka: Russian losses from October 10 to 20",
                url: "https://frontelligence.substack.com/p/avdiivka-russian-losses-from-october",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "FDD's Long War Journal",
                date: "Mar 2024",
                title: "Battle of Avdiivka: a preliminary analysis",
                url: "https://www.longwarjournal.org/archives/2024/03/battle-of-avdiivka-a-preliminary-analysis.php",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "Wikipedia",
                date: "2024",
                title: "Battle of Avdiivka (2023–2024)",
                url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Avdiivka_(2023%E2%80%932024)",
            ),
        ],
    ),

    // ---- The battle's part (bav_sim::data) ----
    // The 47th's and the 110th's side as Units and Support: Stugnas and Javelins in the positions, a Leopard 2A6
    // in a hide, and the 55th's guns with a working day's rounds; cluster shells come in phase 5, the Bradleys as
    // units in phase 6 (design/avdiivka.md). FPVs were a daily stock by this autumn (arcs.md §6).
    catalog: [
        (
            id: "stugna",
            name: ("Stugna-P team", "Розрахунок «Стугни-П»"),
            what: Post(Some(Stugna)),
            cost: 8,
            supply: 5,
            available: 5,
        ),
        (
            id: "javelin",
            name: ("Javelin team", "Розрахунок «Джавеліна»"),
            what: Post(Some(Javelin)),
            cost: 9,
            supply: 5,
            available: 4,
        ),
        (
            id: "rifles",
            name: ("Rifle section", "Стрілецьке відділення"),
            what: Post(None),
            cost: 3,
            supply: 2,
            available: 9,
        ),
        (id: "tank", name: ("Tank in a hide", "Танк у капонірі"), what: Hide, cost: 10, supply: 6, available: 3),
        (id: "bradley", name: ("Bradley", "«Бредлі»"), what: Vehicle(Bradley), cost: 7, supply: 6, available: 6),
        (id: "mtlb", name: ("MT-LB", "МТ-ЛБ"), what: Vehicle(Mtlb), cost: 4, supply: 4, available: 3),
    ],
    support: [
        (id: "155", name: ("155 mm, 16 rounds", "155 мм, 16 пострілів"), what: Shells(16), cost: 4, available: 10),
        (id: "raam", name: ("RAAM mission", "Дистанційне мінування (RAAM)"), what: Raam, cost: 3, available: 6),
        (id: "himars", name: ("HIMARS mission", "Удар HIMARS"), what: Himars, cost: 8, available: 2),
        (
            id: "brigade",
            name: ("Brigade guns, 20 rounds", "Бригадна артилерія, 20 пострілів"),
            what: Brigade(20),
            cost: 2,
            available: 10,
        ),
        (
            id: "mortar",
            name: ("120 mm mortars, 20 bombs", "Міномети 120 мм, 20 мін"),
            what: Mortar(20),
            cost: 1,
            available: 10,
        ),
        (id: "fpv", name: ("FPV strike drone", "FPV-дрон"), what: Fpv, cost: 2, available: 20),
        (id: "mavic", name: ("Two more Mavic 3s", "Ще два Mavic 3"), what: Mavic(2), cost: 3, available: 2),
    ],
    // The Record: the ATGM teams at the village's edge and along the railway, riflemen on the heap and at the
    // plant's corner, a tank in the village, 96 rounds, three RAAM missions, one HIMARS, a dozen FPVs.
    allotment: (
        points: 180,
        supply: (12, 2.0),
        record: [
            (id: "stugna", at: Some(0)),
            (id: "javelin", at: Some(1)),
            (id: "rifles", at: Some(2)),
            (id: "stugna", at: Some(3)),
            (id: "javelin", at: Some(4)),
            (id: "stugna", at: Some(5)),
            (id: "rifles", at: Some(6)),
            (id: "rifles", at: Some(7)),
            (id: "rifles", at: Some(8)),
            (id: "tank", at: Some(9)),
            (id: "155", count: 6),
            (id: "raam", count: 3),
            (id: "himars", count: 1),
            (id: "brigade", count: 6),
            (id: "mortar", count: 6),
            (id: "fpv", count: 12),
        ],
    ),
    old_wreck_kinds: [],
    space_key: Atgm,
    shift_fire: Raam,
    // Their guns work the village, the railway and the heap all day, and the ground behind.
    ru_guns: Some(Posts(x: (-1800.0, 1800.0), band: (-1300.0, -600.0))),
    registered_fire: (50.0, 6),
    // Their EW: jammers with the columns' start lines, the rear emitters past the heap's far foot.
    ew: Some((jammers: [(1300.0, 1700.0), (-900.0, 1750.0)], radius: 900.0, depth: 700.0)),
    // FPVs by the day (phase 4 makes them a stock; one at a time until then), five minutes in the air.
    fpv: Some((endurance: 300.0)),
    // Command's Enemy staff: Lancets for the Bradleys and the Leopard; Orlans over the village every few minutes.
    staff: (lancets: 3, orlan: (150.0, 300.0)),
    // The drone team behind the village. By October 2023 the Russians found a Mavic pilot less often than in
    // February, but still.
    operator: (pos: (900.0, -1400.0), found_per_hour: 0.2),

    // The day (c11 §2, §6 set piece 1): the fire preparation before dawn, then four columns of 15-22 across the
    // open field, two on Stepove and two on the heap and the railway, with infantry on foot behind them; about 70
    // vehicles on the shoulder (the geolocated count for the whole salient that day).
    script: [
        (2.0, Say("Bird up. Clear, a frost on the stubble. Their guns have been going since four.")),
        (
            10.0,
            Say("All, this is {command}. They are coming today. Everyone knows it. Let them come across the field."),
        ),
        (20.0, Prep(missions: 10, over: 220.0)),
        (120.0, Tos(label: "TOS-1A on the plant's edge")),
        (
            230.0,
            Column(
                route: 0,
                kinds: [
                    T72, T72, Bmp2, Bmp1, Bmp2, T80, Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp1, Bmp2, T72, Bmp1, Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp2, T72, Bmp1,
                    Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp1, Bmp2, Bmp2,
                ],
                plow: true,
                start: 300.0,
                smoke: 3,
                label: "06:35  The 114th Brigade from Krasnohorivka, on Stepove",
            ),
        ),
        (240.0, Jam(0.5)),
        (
            250.0,
            Say("Bird: column from Krasnohorivka. Twenty-plus, tanks leading, a plow in front. Smoke on the field."),
        ),
        (
            330.0,
            Column(
                route: 1,
                kinds: [
                    T80, T80, Bmp2, Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp1, T80, Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp1, Bmp2, Bmp2, T72, Mtlb, Bmp1, Bmp2, Bmp2,
                    Mtlb,
                ],
                plow: true,
                start: 300.0,
                smoke: 2,
                label: "07:00  The 10th Tank Regiment from Kamianka, on the heap",
            ),
        ),
        (345.0, Say("This is {op}. From the east now. Tanks, a lot of BMPs. Straight at the heap.")),
        (
            640.0,
            Column(
                route: 0,
                kinds: [
                    T72, Bmp2, Bmp2, T72, Bmp1, Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp1, Bmp2, Bmp2, T80, Bmp1, Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp2, Bmp1, Bmp2,
                    Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp2,
                ],
                plow: false,
                start: 300.0,
                smoke: 2,
                label: "08:20  A second column. The same field.",
            ),
        ),
        (655.0, Say("This is {op}. Second column. Past the first one's wrecks. Exactly the same line.")),
        (700.0, Infantry(route: 1, groups: 8, size: 6, every: 20.0, label: "08:35  Infantry on foot at the heap")),
        (720.0, Tos(label: "TOS-1A again")),
        (
            950.0,
            Column(
                route: 1,
                kinds: [T72, Bmp2, Bmp1, Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp1, Bmp2, T72, Bmp1, Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp2, Bmp1, Bmp2],
                plow: false,
                start: 300.0,
                smoke: 1,
                label: "09:35  Again, from the east",
            ),
        ),
        (960.0, Jam(0.6)),
        (1100.0, Infantry(route: 0, groups: 6, size: 6, every: 18.0, label: "10:15  Men on foot towards the railway")),
        (1250.0, Say("This is {op}. They are gathering again beyond the heap. Not today, I think.")),
    ],
)
